Given the large increase in EPS (200% YoY) but driven by lower provisions and one-time items, plus ongoing challenges (tight supply, cost pressures, currency), the outlook may be uncertain. The company appears to have improved earnings but underlying margin pressure and supply constraints could limit future growth. Also, tobacco industry faces regulatory headwinds.

