- Guidance for Q3 revenue $450-465M (down from Q2 $474M). Non-GAAP EPS $0.69-$1.02 (but Q2 EPS was $0.09? That seems inconsistent; maybe they meant $0.90? Actually Q2 non-GAAP EPS $0.09 seems low; maybe a typo. Could be $0.90. We'll note discrepancy.)
- They emphasize acquisition of ESI, growth in power solutions, design wins, laser business, ozone, etc.
