**2. Growth drivers** – Loan growth was solid in Q4, driven by commercial lending, and the commercial loan book now represents ~58% of the portfolio. Wealth‑management and the 1031‑exchange acquisition lifted non‑interest income 13% YTD, but non‑interest expense rose 10% in the quarter (6% YTD) as the firm adds staff and compensation.  

