**2. Strong capital position** – Cash of $1.8 billion, zero drawn bank debt, and a long‑term debt profile with an average life of 11.5 years give the firm ample runway to fund growth or return capital. The recent $345 million convertible senior bond (3.875 % coupon, conversion price $39.20) further bolsters liquidity at a cheap cost.  

