**Balance‑sheet strength** – Debt‑to‑capitalization sits at 45%, with $356 million available under a new credit facility, $30.9 million cash, and $347.7 million in natural‑gas‑related assets. The recent $700 million senior‑note issuance was used to retire commercial‑paper debt, further improving liquidity.  

