Rationale:  

**Earnings performance** – Q4 2007 GAAP EPS of $0.56 was flat versus the prior year (‑2% on an operating basis) and full‑year GAAP EPS fell 8% (‑3% on an operating basis). The company is not growing earnings; it is merely holding the line.  

