We need to consider the content: Newell Brands Q2 2019 call. They claim progress: sales growth in 4 of 7 divisions, operating margins ahead of plan, cash flow improvement, cost reductions, SKU reductions, SAP conversions, divestitures, debt reduction, etc. However need to assess overall outlook, risks, sustainability, growth prospects. Also note that they are still in turnaround, some divisions still lag, reliance on cost cuts, limited organic growth, need for further divestitures. The call is from 2019, but we as analyst now evaluate based on that information.

