We need to consider Voya Financial Q2 2019 results. Key points: EPS growth 11% YoY, cost savings on track, $150M saved, target $230-250M by 2020. Strong organic growth: Retirement deposits +9%, Investment net flows $1.1B, Employee Benefits premiums +12%. Excess capital $540M, share repurchases $446M, dividend increase to $0.15, aiming yield 1%. ESG improvements.

