- Legacy loan balances grew 2.4% quarter‑over‑quarter (≈9.6% annualized) and the loan book is now $6.9 bn, indicating steady but modest expansion.  
- Net income of $33.6 m (EPS $0.50) and a return on average tangible equity of 13.7% show solid profitability on the existing base.  

