| **Segment performance** | • **Investment Banking**: strong sequential growth, record debt underwriting, top‑ranked in M&A and equity underwriting. <br>• **Investment Management & Investing & Lending**: solid revenue growth (not quantified in the excerpt). <br>• **Institutional Client Services (FICC)**: revenues down 24% QoQ, full‑year down 18% YoY; low‑volatility environment continues to pressure trading volumes. | Mixed – the diversified model cushions the weakness in FICC, but a sizable, persistent drag from the trading franchise remains a risk to margin expansion. |
