- **Loan portfolio expansion:** Total loans grew 7.8% YoY, with residential mortgages up 21.5% and commercial mortgages up 9.3%. The commercial leasing portfolio surged 28.4% to $245 M.  
- **Deposit growth:** Deposits increased 6.1% YoY, with demand and savings deposits up 8.1%, supporting the loan‑to‑deposit ratio (LDR) of ~99.8% that remains within the company’s historical range.  
