| **Asset mix & duration** | Residential securities portfolio $150 m (leverage $120 m), average life 3‑4 years, expected high‑teen returns. CLO assets $385 m with a two‑year replenishment feature. | Reasonable diversification, but a large portion of the balance sheet is tied to short‑term, non‑recourse financing that must be rolled over or replenished. |
