- Q4 2011 net income jumped 38% YoY, driven by strong ONEOK Partners results. Full‑year 2011 net income rose 8% versus 2010.  
- Stand‑alone cash flow (pre‑working‑capital) exceeded capex and dividend outlays by **$213.7 million**, indicating solid free cash generation.  
