**Revenue & Growth** – Ormat’s Q2 2013 revenue jumped 20.5% YoY to $152.7 million, driven by a 44.9% surge in the product segment and modest 7.1% growth in electricity sales from new capacity (Olkaria III, McGinness Hills). The top‑line expansion is solid, especially given the relatively mature geothermal base business.

