Rationale:  

**Revenue & Growth** – Q1 FY13 revenue was $2.46 bn, essentially flat YoY and down 11 % sequentially. The only bright spot was a 1.2 % constant‑currency increase in the Distribution business and a 17 % YoY rise in the GBS (Concentrix) segment, but the latter represents a tiny fraction of total sales (~$52 m of $2.46 bn). Overall top‑line momentum is stagnant.

