Rationale:  
- **Earnings momentum:** Continuing‑operations income rose 9% YoY to $40.5 million ($1.25 EPS) and the six‑month earnings jumped ~200% to $58.7 million ($1.81 EPS). That level of earnings acceleration is a strong positive signal.  
