| **Cash generation** | Operating cash flow reached $2.9 M, lifting cash on hand to $23 M. Management plans a $2 M stock‑repurchase and retains ample cash for R&D/acquisitions. | Strong liquidity for a company of this scale, but cash burn could accelerate with upcoming product launches and earn‑out payments. |
