**Competitive Positioning**  
- The Security Fabric platform is positioned as a differentiated, end‑to‑end solution (IoT → data‑center, on‑prem & cloud) with unique ASIC‑based SPU delivering 10× performance versus software‑only rivals.  
- Consistent “9‑for‑9” recommendations from NSS Labs and leadership positions in multiple Gartner Magic Quadrants (UTM, Enterprise Firewall, SD‑WAN) reinforce market credibility.  
