Rationale:  

**Revenue & Growth** – Q2 revenue hit a record $1.6 bn, but the organic increase was only 1.7 % (the company even notes that last year’s exceptional performance set a high benchmark). While new‑sales bookings are up (record $590 m in H1 versus $460 m a year ago), the underlying top‑line growth remains modest in a business of this size.

