- **Loan & Deposit Growth:** Total loan portfolio grew 7.8% YoY, with residential mortgages up 21.5% (driven by MD/VA). Commercial mortgage, C&I, and commercial‑leasing portfolios also posted solid double‑digit growth. Deposits rose 6.1% (demand/savings +8.1%, time deposits –3.7%). The loan‑to‑deposit ratio ended at ~99.8%, high but historically acceptable for the firm.  
