- **Guidance tone** – The call ends with “we will continue to invest, we will do so in a prudent way,” but provides no quantitative outlook (e.g., expected revenue growth percentages, margin targets, cap‑ex plans). The lack of specific forward‑looking guidance further weakens confidence.

