Rationale:  

**Earnings performance** – GAAP diluted EPS fell 8% year‑over‑year to $2.00 and, after stripping non‑core items, operating EPS slipped 3% to $2.13. Q4 EPS was flat versus the prior year. The company is essentially delivering flat earnings despite a “strong” net‑interest margin (3.94% in Q4, guidance 3.9‑4%).  

