- **Surface Technologies (North America)** suffered a 19 % sequential revenue decline, driven by a 35 % drop in U.S. rig count and a “Canadian breakup.” Daily fluid‑control orders collapsed, and management does not expect material improvement until 2016. This segment is a sizable portion of total revenue and its weakness drags overall top‑line growth.  
