7. **Risks are being addressed** – The only material downside mentioned is the **Spirit Lake paint‑system issue**, which has driven higher overtime and cost. Management acknowledges the problem, commits to engineering and process discipline, and frames it as a “learning lesson” rather than a systemic failure.  

