- Q3 2018 revenue up 21% YoY to $454 million, beating the broader security market.  
- Product revenue grew ~20% (18% on a comparable basis) and service revenue grew 22%, showing balanced expansion across both high‑margin hardware and recurring subscription lines.  
- Billings rose 22% to $528 million and deferred revenue jumped 27% to $1.5 billion, indicating a strong pipeline and multi‑year contract traction (average contract length now 26 months).  

**Profitability & Cash Generation**  
