analysisWe need to analyze the earnings call statement and decide BUY/HOLD/SELL with rationale. Provide decision as 0 for Buy, 1 for Sell, 2 for Hold. Need to consider revenue decline, net income up, non-fuel revenue growth, cost per ASM down, balance sheet strong, cash high, modest share repurchase, debt increase modest, fleet expansion, pro-rate losses, engine expense swing, weather impact.

