We have limited transcript: they discuss transformation, brand renaissance, sales growth, cost restructuring, SG&A reduction, dividend, share repurchase, debt retirement, same-restaurant sales growth (excluding Red Lobster). Combined sales up 2.4% YoY, continuing ops up 6.2%. EPS GAAP $2.15 includes costs. Need to assess outlook: Red Lobster sale $2.1B, cost restructuring, share repurchase $500-600M, dividend $288M, strong cash flow, but some uncertainties: integration of Yard House (acquired earlier), cost of restructuring, potential stranded costs, macro risks.

