analysisWe need to analyze the earnings-call statement and decide BUY/HOLD/SELL. Provide decision as 0 for Buy, 1 for Sell, 2 for Hold. Need rationale.

We have only partial transcript, but enough to gauge. Autodesk FY2015 transition to subscription/cloud, strong growth in billings, subscriptions, deferred revenue, record cash flow, net new subscriptions 385k, large deals up >50% and >40% value, enterprise license transition $90M to recurring, strong AEC, manufacturing, Fusion 360, PLM 360 growth, upgrade activity, opportunity to convert 3M customers.

